[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0010","text":"那雏菜就在黑板上画画吧～！\n给你画透前辈哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0020","text":"或者来比比谁画得最好～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0030","text":"呵呵\n嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0040","text":"诶，画什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0050","text":"所以说透前辈呀～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0070","text":"……？\n小糸酱不玩吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0080","text":"啊……那个……\n但是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0090","text":"啊哈～，不想玩的话就算了\n明明还能顺便预习美术呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0100","text":"……！\n对、对哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200100_03_0000","text":"Motion"}]
